  "title": {
    "de": "Konzept Auszeit-Wohngemeinschaft - MA 11 Kinder- und Jugendhilfe - Stadt Wien",
    "en": "„Time-Out“ Shared Living Concept - The Vienna child and youth welfare (MA 11) wants to inform the public about the technical details of the “Time-Out” shared living community. On this page, you will find the concept of the “Time-Out” shared living concept, the general concept of neuewege gGmbH, the violence prevention concept, the sex education concept and the trauma-informed concept from neuewege gGmbH."
  },
